#window
(name *) window
(descr *) From your window looking south and southwest, you can see the villages of Obersaalsberg and Untersberg located atop two hills carrying the same names. Saalsberg lies where the Saalach river leaves the alps and meanders across the state-borders to open out into the Eastern river.
(* is #in #study)


